  "content": "\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📋&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#0cf;text-decoration:underline\">一个实用的剪贴板，用于做笔记！</span></span></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔️该模组支持服务端和客户端运行。</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔️该模组支持英语和西班牙语。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔️数据保存在物品中，其他玩家可以看到或编辑它。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔️5页纸张，记录您可能需要的一切内容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔️一个让玩家查看任务的方块。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合成配方 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">[</span><span style=\"color:#936\">\"<span style=\"color:#930\">任意木质压力板，任意木质按钮</span>\"</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">]</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br>[</span>\"剪贴板文件夹合成\"</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">]</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M4ts2lA.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br>[</span>\"墨水与羽毛笔合成\"</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">]</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IEebIaj.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br>[</span>\"剪贴板合成\"</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">]</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#936\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tnCbkiH.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><br>JEI 是可选的，用于查看合成配方。</span><br><img src=\"https://prnt.sc/AHTpn9aHOPFy\" alt=\"\"></p>",
